  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "小李，你把我后备箱里的茅台拿上去好的，赵总，领导的暗示，你能听得懂吗？没有啊，哎他被偷你干什么？赵总，茅台都被偷了，你为什么不让说呀？赵总能不知道车里有没有酒吗？不是，这职场上，李慧错领导的意思是大忌，车里没有酒。赵总却让你送上去，说明他只在意结果，你又何必去纠结车里酒的去向和真实性呢？满足领导的需求最重要。哦，赵总，您车里的东西呢，我不好乱翻，就自己准备了。四瓶两瓶留在您车里了，这两瓶拿上来您先用。赵总，咱们下次见啊。哎好，哎，刘总，你怎么走了呀，是不是嫌报价不满意啊？哼哎，好吧对，恭喜赵总，拿下合同小李，后续你来负责吧。哎，赵总哎，这哎，这赵总这怎么回事啊？这个项目一直是大刘在负责，赵总突然把枪给我了。茶汤回湖是谈判的收尾动作，象征着交易达成。大刘连这个都不懂，赵总怎么敢把项目交给他呀？不能吧，人情世故，可是门大学问，你要学的呀，还多着呢。老婆，赵，总把上次酒钱转过来了，看嘿，你怎么收了呀？赵总转多了，你赶紧给他退回去，你自为有原则的退回，只会让领导觉得麻烦，还不如大大方方收下呢。那我是不是得说点啥呀，你就说感谢领导，大气，果然跟着领导有甜头吃，就这样就行了。当那不行啊，赵总，请大家喝奶茶啦，人人都有。我什么时候请大家喝奶茶了？奶茶钱，您不是跟着酒钱一块转给我了吗？哎，小李周天来家里坐坐，尝尝你嫂子的手艺好好的。哎，嫂子，你可算出来了，我都快憋死了，你拉我干什么？我也很急啊，憋死了，不知道的还以为洗手间是什么好地方。哎呀，行了，你们坐我去做饭，老赵帮我出了一下鱼。老婆，我怎么看？赵总和嫂子有点不高兴，因为异性厕所十分钟效应，人家。赵总，老婆刚从卫生间出来，你就是再着急，你等十分钟再怎么可能是因为这个呀，你照做就行，嫂子，我来帮你。赵总嫂子，那我走了，那我们也先走嗯嗯，小李留下接待王总的事情，咱们再碰一下，那得叫小张回来啊，不用你来负责就行。好的，赵总，哎，老婆，你这个厕所十分钟效应还真有说法，这都是不成文的社交规则。你呀多看看这本把话说的恰到好处。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，你就每天看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你也会变成一个会说话的人我当时听到这句话的时候，我的眼泪就出来了。他写的是别人夸你优秀，你就回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友？你看很有味道，假如不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。哇，这真是太棒了。在这本书里边，有一句话，我特别欣赏。他说有人嘲讽你眼睛小，高情商回答，万物皆有裂痕，那是光照进来的地方。哇，这真是太棒了，每一句都很有意思，随便翻，对吧？哇，这句话太好了，他写的是别人问你一个月工资多少，你就会比以前好多了。现在吃泡面敢放两根肠了。我读到这段的时候，我觉得这个让我真是一解心开啊，这本书就像是个社交宝典，把各种社交场景都变成了问题加答案的形式。你说哪家的书架上不应该有一本这个书，就是手把手的教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，这是我这几年来讲过的最简单的一本书。我觉得这书适合所有人，让你不管在任何场合都能够轻松拿捏。所以强烈推荐。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 510,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00002",
      "start_ms": 710,
      "end_ms": 3230,
      "text": "你把我后备箱里的茅台拿上去好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3230,
      "end_ms": 3590,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4630,
      "end_ms": 5490,
      "text": "领导的暗示，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5490,
      "end_ms": 6625,
      "text": "你能听得懂吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9980,
      "end_ms": 10660,
      "text": "没有啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11460,
      "end_ms": 14000,
      "text": "哎他被偷你干什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14320,
      "end_ms": 14680,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14680,
      "end_ms": 15460,
      "text": "茅台都被偷了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00010",
      "start_ms": 15460,
      "end_ms": 16460,
      "text": "你为什么不让说呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16520,
      "end_ms": 18360,
      "text": "赵总能不知道车里有没有酒吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19640,
      "end_ms": 19980,
      "text": "不是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00013",
      "start_ms": 19980,
      "end_ms": 21600,
      "text": "这职场上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00014",
      "start_ms": 21600,
      "end_ms": 23500,
      "text": "李慧错领导的意思是大忌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00015",
      "start_ms": 23980,
      "end_ms": 24880,
      "text": "车里没有酒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00016",
      "start_ms": 25080,
      "end_ms": 26500,
      "text": "赵总却让你送上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00017",
      "start_ms": 26540,
      "end_ms": 27940,
      "text": "说明他只在意结果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00018",
      "start_ms": 28300,
      "end_ms": 31280,
      "text": "你又何必去纠结车里酒的去向和真实性呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00019",
      "start_ms": 31600,
      "end_ms": 32980,
      "text": "满足领导的需求最重要。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00020",
      "start_ms": 32980,
      "end_ms": 33220,
      "text": "哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00021",
      "start_ms": 37870,
      "end_ms": 38290,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00022",
      "start_ms": 38690,
      "end_ms": 39730,
      "text": "您车里的东西呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00023",
      "start_ms": 39730,
      "end_ms": 40550,
      "text": "我不好乱翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00024",
      "start_ms": 40750,
      "end_ms": 41490,
      "text": "就自己准备了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00025",
      "start_ms": 41490,
      "end_ms": 43210,
      "text": "四瓶两瓶留在您车里了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00026",
      "start_ms": 43210,
      "end_ms": 44765,
      "text": "这两瓶拿上来您先用。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00027",
      "start_ms": 52820,
      "end_ms": 53240,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00028",
      "start_ms": 53480,
      "end_ms": 54520,
      "text": "咱们下次见啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00029",
      "start_ms": 54520,
      "end_ms": 54960,
      "text": "哎好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00030",
      "start_ms": 55920,
      "end_ms": 56160,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00031",
      "start_ms": 56600,
      "end_ms": 56940,
      "text": "刘总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00032",
      "start_ms": 56940,
      "end_ms": 57720,
      "text": "你怎么走了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00033",
      "start_ms": 57720,
      "end_ms": 59060,
      "text": "是不是嫌报价不满意啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00034",
      "start_ms": 59160,
      "end_ms": 61035,
      "text": "哼哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00035",
      "start_ms": 61800,
      "end_ms": 62840,
      "text": "好吧对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00036",
      "start_ms": 63190,
      "end_ms": 63870,
      "text": "恭喜赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00037",
      "start_ms": 63870,
      "end_ms": 65465,
      "text": "拿下合同小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00038",
      "start_ms": 65960,
      "end_ms": 67205,
      "text": "后续你来负责吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00039",
      "start_ms": 67810,
      "end_ms": 68050,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00040",
      "start_ms": 68070,
      "end_ms": 68510,
      "text": "赵总哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00041",
      "start_ms": 68510,
      "end_ms": 71055,
      "text": "这哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00042",
      "start_ms": 71330,
      "end_ms": 72550,
      "text": "这赵总这怎么回事啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00043",
      "start_ms": 72750,
      "end_ms": 74275,
      "text": "这个项目一直是大刘在负责，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00044",
      "start_ms": 74630,
      "end_ms": 75795,
      "text": "赵总突然把枪给我了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00045",
      "start_ms": 76310,
      "end_ms": 78670,
      "text": "茶汤回湖是谈判的收尾动作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00046",
      "start_ms": 79030,
      "end_ms": 80295,
      "text": "象征着交易达成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00047",
      "start_ms": 80650,
      "end_ms": 81945,
      "text": "大刘连这个都不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00048",
      "start_ms": 82260,
      "end_ms": 84225,
      "text": "赵总怎么敢把项目交给他呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00049",
      "start_ms": 84650,
      "end_ms": 85535,
      "text": "不能吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00050",
      "start_ms": 86050,
      "end_ms": 86910,
      "text": "人情世故，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00051",
      "start_ms": 86990,
      "end_ms": 88035,
      "text": "可是门大学问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00052",
      "start_ms": 88550,
      "end_ms": 89450,
      "text": "你要学的呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00053",
      "start_ms": 89510,
      "end_ms": 90335,
      "text": "还多着呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00054",
      "start_ms": 92400,
      "end_ms": 92905,
      "text": "老婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00055",
      "start_ms": 93420,
      "end_ms": 93580,
      "text": "赵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00056",
      "start_ms": 93580,
      "end_ms": 94955,
      "text": "总把上次酒钱转过来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00057",
      "start_ms": 95130,
      "end_ms": 97525,
      "text": "看嘿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00058",
      "start_ms": 97830,
      "end_ms": 98570,
      "text": "你怎么收了呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00059",
      "start_ms": 98610,
      "end_ms": 99390,
      "text": "赵总转多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00060",
      "start_ms": 99390,
      "end_ms": 100475,
      "text": "你赶紧给他退回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00061",
      "start_ms": 100830,
      "end_ms": 102570,
      "text": "你自为有原则的退回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00062",
      "start_ms": 102770,
      "end_ms": 104205,
      "text": "只会让领导觉得麻烦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00063",
      "start_ms": 104560,
      "end_ms": 106205,
      "text": "还不如大大方方收下呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00064",
      "start_ms": 108670,
      "end_ms": 110285,
      "text": "那我是不是得说点啥呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00065",
      "start_ms": 110560,
      "end_ms": 111780,
      "text": "你就说感谢领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00066",
      "start_ms": 111780,
      "end_ms": 112200,
      "text": "大气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00067",
      "start_ms": 112280,
      "end_ms": 113775,
      "text": "果然跟着领导有甜头吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00068",
      "start_ms": 114300,
      "end_ms": 115145,
      "text": "就这样就行了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00069",
      "start_ms": 115640,
      "end_ms": 116705,
      "text": "当那不行啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00070",
      "start_ms": 119070,
      "end_ms": 119530,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00071",
      "start_ms": 119590,
      "end_ms": 120510,
      "text": "请大家喝奶茶啦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00072",
      "start_ms": 120530,
      "end_ms": 121150,
      "text": "人人都有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00073",
      "start_ms": 126040,
      "end_ms": 127725,
      "text": "我什么时候请大家喝奶茶了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00074",
      "start_ms": 128040,
      "end_ms": 128560,
      "text": "奶茶钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00075",
      "start_ms": 128700,
      "end_ms": 130655,
      "text": "您不是跟着酒钱一块转给我了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00076",
      "start_ms": 131940,
      "end_ms": 132225,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00077",
      "start_ms": 133420,
      "end_ms": 136065,
      "text": "小李周天来家里坐坐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00078",
      "start_ms": 136500,
      "end_ms": 139355,
      "text": "尝尝你嫂子的手艺好好的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00079",
      "start_ms": 143380,
      "end_ms": 143620,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00080",
      "start_ms": 143900,
      "end_ms": 144240,
      "text": "嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00081",
      "start_ms": 144240,
      "end_ms": 145060,
      "text": "你可算出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00082",
      "start_ms": 145060,
      "end_ms": 146035,
      "text": "我都快憋死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00083",
      "start_ms": 146350,
      "end_ms": 147210,
      "text": "你拉我干什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00084",
      "start_ms": 147210,
      "end_ms": 148050,
      "text": "我也很急啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00085",
      "start_ms": 148050,
      "end_ms": 148810,
      "text": "憋死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00086",
      "start_ms": 148910,
      "end_ms": 152265,
      "text": "不知道的还以为洗手间是什么好地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00087",
      "start_ms": 152760,
      "end_ms": 153120,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00088",
      "start_ms": 153120,
      "end_ms": 153645,
      "text": "行了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00089",
      "start_ms": 153980,
      "end_ms": 155005,
      "text": "你们坐我去做饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00090",
      "start_ms": 155310,
      "end_ms": 156495,
      "text": "老赵帮我出了一下鱼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00091",
      "start_ms": 157450,
      "end_ms": 157875,
      "text": "老婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00092",
      "start_ms": 158210,
      "end_ms": 158915,
      "text": "我怎么看？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00093",
      "start_ms": 159420,
      "end_ms": 160875,
      "text": "赵总和嫂子有点不高兴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00094",
      "start_ms": 161180,
      "end_ms": 162985,
      "text": "因为异性厕所十分钟效应，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00095",
      "start_ms": 163300,
      "end_ms": 163560,
      "text": "人家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00096",
      "start_ms": 163560,
      "end_ms": 163840,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00097",
      "start_ms": 163840,
      "end_ms": 165260,
      "text": "老婆刚从卫生间出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00098",
      "start_ms": 165260,
      "end_ms": 165940,
      "text": "你就是再着急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00099",
      "start_ms": 165940,
      "end_ms": 168545,
      "text": "你等十分钟再怎么可能是因为这个呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00100",
      "start_ms": 169160,
      "end_ms": 170135,
      "text": "你照做就行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00101",
      "start_ms": 171310,
      "end_ms": 171630,
      "text": "嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00102",
      "start_ms": 171630,
      "end_ms": 172315,
      "text": "我来帮你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00103",
      "start_ms": 173980,
      "end_ms": 174820,
      "text": "赵总嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00104",
      "start_ms": 174960,
      "end_ms": 175585,
      "text": "那我走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00105",
      "start_ms": 176240,
      "end_ms": 178605,
      "text": "那我们也先走嗯嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00106",
      "start_ms": 180020,
      "end_ms": 182180,
      "text": "小李留下接待王总的事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00107",
      "start_ms": 182180,
      "end_ms": 183000,
      "text": "咱们再碰一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00108",
      "start_ms": 183260,
      "end_ms": 184535,
      "text": "那得叫小张回来啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00109",
      "start_ms": 186900,
      "end_ms": 189080,
      "text": "不用你来负责就行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00110",
      "start_ms": 190280,
      "end_ms": 190720,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00111",
      "start_ms": 190720,
      "end_ms": 191120,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00112",
      "start_ms": 191480,
      "end_ms": 191720,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00113",
      "start_ms": 191800,
      "end_ms": 192200,
      "text": "老婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00114",
      "start_ms": 192400,
      "end_ms": 194780,
      "text": "你这个厕所十分钟效应还真有说法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00115",
      "start_ms": 194900,
      "end_ms": 196520,
      "text": "这都是不成文的社交规则。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00116",
      "start_ms": 196660,
      "end_ms": 199440,
      "text": "你呀多看看这本把话说的恰到好处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00117",
      "start_ms": 199740,
      "end_ms": 200880,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00118",
      "start_ms": 200880,
      "end_ms": 201540,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00119",
      "start_ms": 201680,
      "end_ms": 202500,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00120",
      "start_ms": 202700,
      "end_ms": 203760,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00121",
      "start_ms": 203940,
      "end_ms": 205080,
      "text": "你就每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00122",
      "start_ms": 205220,
      "end_ms": 206520,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00123",
      "start_ms": 206680,
      "end_ms": 210060,
      "text": "你也会变成一个会说话的人我当时听到这句话的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00124",
      "start_ms": 210060,
      "end_ms": 211240,
      "text": "我的眼泪就出来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00125",
      "start_ms": 211260,
      "end_ms": 212860,
      "text": "他写的是别人夸你优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00126",
      "start_ms": 212980,
      "end_ms": 213520,
      "text": "你就回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00127",
      "start_ms": 213720,
      "end_ms": 214640,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00128",
      "start_ms": 214760,
      "end_ms": 215900,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00129",
      "start_ms": 216040,
      "end_ms": 217190,
      "text": "你看很有味道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00130",
      "start_ms": 217290,
      "end_ms": 218250,
      "text": "假如不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00131",
      "start_ms": 218270,
      "end_ms": 218970,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00132",
      "start_ms": 218970,
      "end_ms": 219750,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00133",
      "start_ms": 219930,
      "end_ms": 220950,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00134",
      "start_ms": 221090,
      "end_ms": 222210,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00135",
      "start_ms": 222310,
      "end_ms": 223510,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00136",
      "start_ms": 223650,
      "end_ms": 225870,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00137",
      "start_ms": 225990,
      "end_ms": 226230,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00138",
      "start_ms": 226430,
      "end_ms": 227530,
      "text": "这真是太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00139",
      "start_ms": 227610,
      "end_ms": 228490,
      "text": "在这本书里边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00140",
      "start_ms": 228490,
      "end_ms": 229010,
      "text": "有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00141",
      "start_ms": 229010,
      "end_ms": 229790,
      "text": "我特别欣赏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00142",
      "start_ms": 229930,
      "end_ms": 231530,
      "text": "他说有人嘲讽你眼睛小，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00143",
      "start_ms": 231610,
      "end_ms": 232550,
      "text": "高情商回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00144",
      "start_ms": 232650,
      "end_ms": 233750,
      "text": "万物皆有裂痕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00145",
      "start_ms": 233830,
      "end_ms": 235230,
      "text": "那是光照进来的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00146",
      "start_ms": 235290,
      "end_ms": 235530,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00147",
      "start_ms": 235550,
      "end_ms": 236610,
      "text": "这真是太棒了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00148",
      "start_ms": 236610,
      "end_ms": 237810,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00149",
      "start_ms": 237950,
      "end_ms": 238490,
      "text": "随便翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00150",
      "start_ms": 238490,
      "end_ms": 238870,
      "text": "对吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00151",
      "start_ms": 238870,
      "end_ms": 239110,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00152",
      "start_ms": 239230,
      "end_ms": 240235,
      "text": "这句话太好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00153",
      "start_ms": 240410,
      "end_ms": 242395,
      "text": "他写的是别人问你一个月工资多少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00154",
      "start_ms": 242640,
      "end_ms": 243920,
      "text": "你就会比以前好多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00155",
      "start_ms": 243940,
      "end_ms": 245615,
      "text": "现在吃泡面敢放两根肠了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00156",
      "start_ms": 245810,
      "end_ms": 246930,
      "text": "我读到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00157",
      "start_ms": 247010,
      "end_ms": 248950,
      "text": "我觉得这个让我真是一解心开啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00158",
      "start_ms": 248970,
      "end_ms": 250630,
      "text": "这本书就像是个社交宝典，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00159",
      "start_ms": 250750,
      "end_ms": 253670,
      "text": "把各种社交场景都变成了问题加答案的形式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00160",
      "start_ms": 253789,
      "end_ms": 256235,
      "text": "你说哪家的书架上不应该有一本这个书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00161",
      "start_ms": 256520,
      "end_ms": 259700,
      "text": "就是手把手的教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00162",
      "start_ms": 259900,
      "end_ms": 262660,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00163",
      "start_ms": 262660,
      "end_ms": 263860,
      "text": "你就放心拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00164",
      "start_ms": 263920,
      "end_ms": 265160,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00165",
      "start_ms": 265240,
      "end_ms": 267740,
      "text": "这是我这几年来讲过的最简单的一本书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00166",
      "start_ms": 268000,
      "end_ms": 269580,
      "text": "我觉得这书适合所有人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00167",
      "start_ms": 269600,
      "end_ms": 272160,
      "text": "让你不管在任何场合都能够轻松拿捏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cd9315d5561d0128_s00168",
      "start_ms": 272320,
      "end_ms": 273265,
      "text": "所以强烈推荐。"
    }
  ],
